@prefix ex: <https://example.org/local-ai/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

ex:ontology a owl:Ontology .
ex:Task a owl:Class .
ex:OfflineTask a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:Task .
ex:Capability a owl:Class .
ex:Evidence a owl:Class .
ex:Hypothesis a owl:Class .
ex:UnresolvedQuestion a owl:Class .
ex:requiresCapability a owl:ObjectProperty .
ex:dependsOn a owl:ObjectProperty .
ex:status a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
ex:supportedBy a owl:ObjectProperty .
